{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-11_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-11",
  "title": "冰原之雪",
  "storyCode": "6-12",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa45a42e2c1571fe93df369e95c40f699dcd330b71bc202f8876fdba4dc8e9f3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "我确认过了，所有能联系上的整合运动队伍已经全部撤出了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "人真多啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "浩浩荡荡的......就像河水一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大熊",
      "text": "荒原上会出现一条河流......一条逃难者的河流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大熊",
      "text": "既有乌萨斯人，也有龙门人。既有感染者，也有普通人。来时他们或贫或富，去时他们两手空空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大熊",
      "text": "原本他们认定有一个地方可以接受自己，现在他们知道自己总归无处可去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大熊",
      "text": "这条河流，最终会从这荒原上消逝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "（他的语气好悲伤。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "（从大爹那学的吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "（也难怪。这个时候了，人难免有些感伤的。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "如果大爹在这，我们一定打得赢，也不用走到这个地步吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "运气好坏这种事儿，你再怎么考虑另一种结局都没用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "......准备一下。我去和幻影弩手们商量下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "别催我呀，我又不是不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "赶紧去，别墨迹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "我也挺感伤的啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "确定了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "是雪怪小队。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "阿米娅他们呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "已经赶赴现场了。阿米娅要我嘱托你，“别冲动”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "这话和没说一样。她知道的......要说冲动，我在罗德岛算得上是第一名了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "煌！你去哪！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "去救人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "弩手们！请稍等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "雪怪......等等，你这是做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "......霜星大姊她的身体，已经支撑不了多久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "她刚刚为了击退龙门的部队，已经耗尽了气力。可能一时半会儿还醒不过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "你的意思是要我们再带上她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "可我们本不准备回切尔诺伯格。浮士德也不希望梅菲斯特......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "我们恳求你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "我们都希望大姊最后，最后能和爱国者一起度过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "虽然他们的关系现在有点不好，但我们知道的......他们之间的亲情比血还浓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "我们......恳求你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "你们呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "我们给你们殿后。如果不给你们拖一段时间，你们很快就会被龙门追上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "等你们和其他人走远了，对龙门没有威胁了，他们也不好再追缉你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "可那样的话，你们就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "只要战斗，就总会战死的。战死在这里，我们都觉得不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "霜星大姊她说的未来，有一点远。但我们其实也不必亲眼看见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "又欠了你们一条命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你们也帮我们带上了大姊。这不算什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "......我们一定完成你们的托付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "这个，护臂和防护装，你穿上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "这是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "大姊的温度会冷到你受不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "......她......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "......她好轻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "法术掏空了她的身体。轻点，再轻点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "别弄醒她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "你看她......看她睡得多熟啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "再见了，大姊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "text": "我们会等你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "......就这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "我们......先走一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "是我们先走一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幻影弩手",
      "text": "总会再见面的，雪怪们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
      "text": "希望这一天来得迟些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "我们要死了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*，你怎么就流眼泪了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "你这样也算雪怪吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "你不也在哭？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "我哭什么了我！......你忘了大姐怎么说的吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "她说别哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "对！她说别哭......十多年前，她说别哭！别掉眼泪！我们不配......因为我们还没打赢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "等我们赢了，等我们自由了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "我们自由了，我们会放声大哭，在荒野里在雪地里，在堆得满满的麦垛里放声大哭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "明明大姊也一边说一边哭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "那时她才九岁啊。我们都比她要大好几岁啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "没有大姊，我们已经死在那座矿场了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "你带了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "带什么......等等，不是不准带吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "是不准行军的时候喝。但你带身上的，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "我也想喝......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "不成，你年龄没到啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
      "text": "可，可我以前没有喝过啊，我不想味道都没尝过就......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "给他一点吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "佩特洛娃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "行啊。喝一点吧。可别喝太多，我们都要匀匀的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "text": "兄弟们，都喝一点吧，暖暖身子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
      "text": "敬大姊和大老爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队全体",
      "text": "敬霜星和爱国者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "你认识这些感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "是的，陈长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但这最后一场战斗必须现在打响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "我们有得选吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我们可能别无选择。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "看看你的身后。现在的他们甚至没有刻意隐藏自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......黑色雨披。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "所以，我们必须要和他们战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这是我们必须要做的。不这么做，我们就会落下把柄，把特殊部队强行拉来压制雪怪小队的行为也会变得毫无说服力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不过，你有没有可能劝服他们投降？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "只要他们的身后还有感染者......他们就不会投降。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "......阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我不会逼你们参与战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "抱歉，陈长官。但是......但是我们会见证。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "近卫局英勇坚决地战斗了，没人能否认。你们在为了龙门而战，你们抗击了侵略者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "这是我们帮助你们对抗那些特殊部队的方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "而对于我们自己来说......我们要记下每一场感染者的战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "每一场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "阿米娅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "陈长官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "战斗结束以后，我们一起去吃个饭吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "可，可我是感染者......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "不用在意。那个声音很大的，个子很高的，这两个人也不会在意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "这场战斗......无论是谁都损失太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "对于我们来说是战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "对于龙门来说，这确确实实是一场战争。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "战争就是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "但是那个策划了这一切的人，并不在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "我想，我有必须要告知你们的事情——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "text": "——但不是现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "没错，不是现在，陈警官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "博士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不想看吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......嗯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我.......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但就像在切城废城时那样......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "对。我已经下定决心了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我必须要......亲眼去看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们一起。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我们一起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
          "text": "原来叫大姊......不是因为年龄才这么叫？我为什么现在才知道？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "得了，你必须得这么叫。那年你才三岁。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
          "text": "嘁！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "嘿，态度这么差，没两口就醉了？你喊饿的时候，我是少分你面包了还是没把汤匀给你了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
          "text": "这个是这个，那个是......那个！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "说来，有些好笑。我突然在想罗德岛那些人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "想他们干嘛？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "那个浑身冒热气的猫，说要和我们一起喝点那只。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "有些遗憾。她看上去量不错，胡闹起来也一定很带劲。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "但那只小兔子，怎么也没到这个岁数吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "她多大？十六？十七？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "也就十四左右吧。只是逼着自己说些大人会说的话而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "和大姊那时候......一样啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "这最后一点就敬他们吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
          "text": "祝他们说到做到！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "大熊",
          "text": "说到做到！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员D",
          "text": "唔，呃......说到做到！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "龙门人理应比他们还要齐心。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "快走吧，别看了。雪怪也只能拖一时。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "你不觉得他们的行为很可贵？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "如果我们没命了，那他们岂不是白干？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "按幻影弩手的说法，切尔诺伯格我们确实是回不去了。我们要往新的据点去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "你不关心新据点是哪？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "不管是哪里，我会和你们一起走。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "哎。你们龙门人，和我们也没区别啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "本来还想他们会待你们好一点呢，没想到和乌萨斯差不多一回事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "感染者在哪都一样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "你刚来的时候可不是这么说的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "九",
          "text": "人是会变的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "是雪怪吗？那些是雪怪吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "是雪怪！是......是雪怪没错！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "雪怪......雪怪！这群雪怪怎么这么倔？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "可恶，可恶！别死！别送死啊！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "等我过来，我能救你们，我带你们走......带你们走！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "为什么像你们这样的感染者也要死在这里？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "特殊部队停止进攻了？不，他们好像撤退了......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "似乎......是把主动权交给我们了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "这是要凸显下龙门的执法力量？*龙门粗口*，还真是被彻底看低了啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "......算了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "各位，最后一波进攻了。别辜负市民和陈sir的期望。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
          "text": "让他们看看吧，让这些整合运动明白龙门的实力！让所有感染者都再也不敢冒犯龙门！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "哈......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "幻影弩手们，可别让我们失望啊。一定要把大姊送回老爷子身边。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "......她没多少时间了。最后的时间里和老爷子一起过吧，大姊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
          "text": "我们也没多少时间了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "安排完了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
          "text": "全部都做好了。让我们把这条命还了吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
          "text": "让他们见识一下，由乌萨斯最伟大的战士博卓卡斯替训练，由乌萨斯最冷的梦魇带领的小队，究竟是什么样子！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "大姊最后残留的一点源石技艺......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "霜冻源石，准备释放！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "佩特洛娃",
          "text": "大熊！我们上了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "雪怪！！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
